nodecode-anyrouter is a rewrite of AnyRouterHQ's AnyRouterHQ/hermes-provider-anyrouter:
https://github.com/AnyRouterHQ/hermes-provider-anyrouter
commit ba9fd9c05570800dcbbf6dae4605fd4106880d27
